SUMMARY:Caleb Wheeler Curtis & Jason Moran: "Incantation" Album Release Cel
 ebration
LOCATION:National Sawdust\, 80 N 6th St\, Brooklyn\, NY 11249
DESCRIPTION:Saxophonist and multi-instrumentalist Caleb Wheeler Curtis and 
 venerated pianist\, artist\, and MacArthur fellow Jason Moran celebrate th
 e release of “Incantation” (Imani Records\, 2026). Guided by their pow
 erful and dynamic sounds and a shared fascination with musical ancestry\, 
 they explore space\, time\, and melody.\nhttps://www.nationalsawdust.org/e
 vent/caleb-wheeler-curtis-jason-moran-incantation-album-release-celebratio
 n\nFrom Pushpin NYC: https://pushpin.city/nyc/
URL:https://www.nationalsawdust.org/event/caleb-wheeler-curtis-jason-moran-
 incantation-album-release-celebration
END:VEVENT
