SUMMARY:Inside PROTOTYPE 2027—A Conversation with OperaWire
LOCATION:National Sawdust\, 80 N 6th St\, Brooklyn\, NY 11249
DESCRIPTION:Join PROTOTYPE\, National Sawdust\, and OperaWire for a special
  festival preview celebrating the launch of the PROTOTYPE 2027 and the vis
 ionary artists\, stories\, and performances shaping this year’s lineup. 
 Hosted at National Sawdust\, this season preview will give audiences a fir
 st glimpse of the bold new works featured in this year’s festival. The e
 vening will feature intimate performances and conversations with the compo
 sers\, performers\, and creative teams shaping the season’s most excitin
 g projects—sharing the inspirations\, processes\, and stories behind the
 ir work.\nhttps://www.nationalsawdust.org/event/inside-prototype-2027--a-c
 onversation-with-operawire\nFrom Pushpin NYC: https://pushpin.city/nyc/
URL:https://www.nationalsawdust.org/event/inside-prototype-2027--a-conversa
 tion-with-operawire
END:VEVENT
