  mezzo-soprano) and a Work-In-Development Presentation of Red Thread (Musi
 c by Wang Lu\, Libretto by Deborah Brevoort\, Conducted by Anthony Cheung)
 .\nhttps://www.nationalsawdust.org/event/the-seen-and-the-unseen-1-21-27\n
